/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!field_has_tag(T, field, tag)`,
 * `__pragma!field_tag(T, field, tag)` and `__pragma!field_tags(T, field, tag)`
 * constructs.
 *
 * The pragmas read at compile time the sites of a tag written on top of a
 * field of a class or a record.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::field_tag
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/field_tag.yr
 * @Author(s):
